  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3>Tool identification</h3> <h2>The digital identity of your tool holders</h2>",
   "body": "<p><strong>The ZOLLER »idChip« is a coded chip made of extremely robust plastic, permanently integrated into the tool holder. Its DataMatrix code makes every holder uniquely identifiable – at the presetting and measuring machine, at the shrink fit machine, in the tool storage and at the CNC machine.</strong></p> <p>This way you always know everything about your tool holders: number of heating cycles, uses on the machine and much more. Product service life, digital twin and further information are available anytime, anywhere – at costs far below those of RFID transponders.</p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/1/7/csm_zoller_smarte_solutions_171a2dc46c.webp",
     "w": 1454,
     "h": 1454,
     "alt": "Tool holders with »idChip«"
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "id": "idchip-intro",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {
    "before": "default",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2>Firmly integrated. Protected in the holder.</h2>",
   "body": "<p>The »idChip« sits in the chip bore of the tool holder and is bonded in place with two-component adhesive. Together with the adhesive, the 3-groove technology in the chip bore creates a form fit – for a secure and firm connection. This keeps the chip protected while it remains clearly visible.</p> <p>On ZOLLER Tooling tool holders with HSK-A hollow shank taper, SK steep taper and PSC polygonal shank taper, the chip bore is standard. It takes the »idChip« or other data carriers such as RFID chips.</p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/7/9/csm_chip_edd3e9cbeb.webp",
     "w": 1524,
     "h": 887,
     "alt": "»idChip« with DataMatrix code in the chip bore"
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "left",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "id": "idchip-fix",
   "bg": "lightgray",
   "space": {
    "before": "default",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2>Scan once. Know everything.</h2>",
   "body": "<p>A single scan of the DataMatrix code is all it takes: the tool is uniquely identified and the associated tool data comes straight from the database. Input errors and mix-ups are a thing of the past.</p> <p>All you need is a scanner that reads the DataMatrix code and software that manages your tool data. ZOLLER offers both with »zidCode 4.0« and TMS Tool Management Solutions.</p> <p>In TMS Tool Management Solutions, every holder is managed by its ID. The »idChip« is intended as optional hardware for the »z.Shopfloor« and »z.Connectivity« add-ons.</p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/d/7/csm_software_idchip_9694061981.webp",
     "w": 1000,
     "h": 563,
     "alt": "Scanning the »idChip« with the hand scanner"
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "id": "idchip-scan",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {
    "before": "default",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2>One code for the entire tool cycle</h2>",
   "body": "<p>The »idChip« accompanies the tool holder through every station – and ZOLLER solutions recognize it everywhere.</p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/e/4/csm_venturion_header_2a53427792.webp",
     "w": 1080,
     "h": 930,
     "alt": "",
     "title": "Presetting & Measuring",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Presetting & Measuring</h3> <p>Scan at the presetting and measuring machine: the tool data is retrieved directly and the measuring parameters are loaded automatically. Every tool is measured the same way, every time.</p> </figcaption>",
     "href": "/produkte/einstellen-messen"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/6/f/csm_option_zidcode_01_45e04f3e38.webp",
     "w": 792,
     "h": 457,
     "alt": "",
     "title": "Shrink Technology",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Shrink Technology</h3> <p>Scan at the »powerShrink«: all shrink parameters are instantly available in the »pilot« software. Every heating cycle is counted per shrink chuck, and warning and wear limits can be stored.</p> </figcaption>",
     "href": "/produkte/schrumpftechnik/powershrink"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/3/b/csm_software_zidCode4_7a2e75321f.webp",
     "w": 1920,
     "h": 1690,
     "alt": "",
     "title": "At the machine",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>At the machine</h3> <p>Scan with »zidCode 4.0« at the CNC machine: the tool data comes from the database and goes into the machine control quickly and without errors.</p> </figcaption>",
     "href": "/produkte/toolmanagement/zidcode"
    }
   ],
