  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2>Factory-fitted or retrofitted</h2>",
   "body": "<p>On request, we supply all ZOLLER Tooling tool holders with a permanently integrated »idChip« and DataMatrix code – balanced with the chip and delivered straight to your production.</p> <p>Existing tools can also be fitted with the »idChip« at any time. Simply contact our sales team.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/unternehmen/kontakt\">Request a quote</a></p>",
